# Volta Signal Worker

- `volta-signal/` is the send path. Do not add send to the Next.js studio.
- Never put secrets in `wrangler.toml`, logs, Slack, or `/architecture`.
- Do not enable sources that are not already in `src/sources.ts`.
- Send test is Mailchimp test. Approve and send is the list send and needs `LIVE_SEND_ENABLED`.
- Point at existing files instead of copying their contents into rules or skills.
